        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Sylph",
            "It was one of the materials used to develop Construct Tech back in the day, though it was eventually replaced by Tantalum-193... We need to find out why the Ascendant is collecting it.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Leia",
