        "Id": 86,
        "ActionId": 86,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Leia",
            "Are you saying he didn't know enough?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 87,
        "ActionId": 87,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Sylph",
            "I'm afraid so, and he probably knew even less than Amazigh did. I have no interest in condemning a dead man, but if he truly understood what he was doing...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 88,
        "ActionId": 88,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Sylph",
            "He should have exposed everything before he worked with the Ascendant and those corrupt officials.",
            2
        ]
    },
