        "Id": 89,
        "ActionId": 89,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            14
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 90,
        "ActionId": 90,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Leia",
            "But then he never could have saved Caro and the others...",
            1
