        "Id": 91,
        "ActionId": 91,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Sylph",
            "He believed he was doing good, but you and I both know that he committed an unforgivable sin.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 92,
        "ActionId": 92,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Sylph",
            "Leia, what's right and what's wrong... it's not something I'm equipped to judge.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 93,
        "ActionId": 93,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Sylph",
            "That's why I joined the Purifying Force and became a Construct that hunts nothing but sin and darkness.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 94,
        "ActionId": 94,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Sylph",
            "Exterminating sin and darkness is so much simpler than trying to untangle what's right and wrong in human nature.",
